WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:08.641 line:92%
♪ ♪

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:09.609 line:92%
Morning.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:15.515
- Ron.
- Good morning, Mr. Sheltie.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.783 line:92%
How's the fam?

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.751
Oh, I don't--I don't have--
I'm single, sir.

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.353
I'm not married.
I mean, I do have a girlfriend.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:21.354 line:92%
That's great.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:22.555
[coughs]
Oh, God!

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:24.424 line:92%
[slaps hands]

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.692
Hey, I need you
to do me a favor.

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:27.726 line:92%
