00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.696
that the bagels are
for sales associates only.

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:33.366 line:92%
No problem, sir.

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:36.202
All right, let's get
this sales presentation started.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.403 line:92%
