00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.838 line:92%
All right, who's hungover?

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:39.839
[laughter]
Not me.

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.641 line:92%
I know Ron is.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.109 line:92%
That's not true.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.110 line:92%
You're an alcoholic.

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.311 line:92%
