00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.246 line:92%
I'm not, sir, I'm not.

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:48.581 line:92%
♪ ♪

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:52.685
Hey, guys,
sales associates, friends.

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:55.288 line:92%
Today I want to talk about...

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.589 line:92%
the world's oldest profession.

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:59.625
[laughs]
Now hold on, hold on!

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:00.860
I know, I know
what you're thinking, right?

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.161 line:92%
Sex and prostitutes.

00:01:02.194 --> 00:01:03.696
That's not
what I'm talking about.

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:04.697 line:92%
Okay?

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.532 line:92%
I'm talking about sales.

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:09.235
And if you look at our
ancient history as human beings,

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:10.670 line:92%
the first caveman out there...

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.673 line:92%
[ominous music]

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:21.581 line:92%
♪ ♪

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.783
Oh, I'm sorry, those are
for sales associates only.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:24.851 line:92%
It's food.

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.487
N-not for you,
I'm sorry.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.689
Bagels are just
for sales associates.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:30.890 line:92%
For sale?

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:32.225 line:92%
No, it's free.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.392 line:92%
Oh, for free?

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:34.727 line:92%
Not--not for you, though.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:35.761 line:92%
It's just for me?

00:01:35.794 --> 00:01:36.762 line:92%
No, the--

00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:39.165 line:92%
To divide ourselves...

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.267
The bagels are
only for sales associates.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.136 line:92%
Ron.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.237 line:92%
Love the enthusiasm,

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.638 line:92%
but it's a little distracting.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:46.806 line:92%
[laughter]

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.274
I'm sorry.
I'm sorry, sir.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:49.775 line:92%
Oh, don't do it again, please.

00:01:49.808 --> 00:01:51.177 line:92%
Sorry.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.378
(Sheltie)
Moving on...

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:53.579 line:92%
For me maybe?

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:54.714 line:92%
No, not--not maybe.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.149
I'm sorry,
I'm so sorry.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.150 line:92%
Foss?

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.417 line:92%
Foss--what?

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.418 line:92%
For us?

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:00.786
For us?
No, no, not for us.

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:02.288 line:92%
One, just one.

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:03.689
It's just that they're
for sales associates only.

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:04.924 line:92%
For me maybe?

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:07.293 line:92%
