00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:08.528
- Forget--
- Okay, Ron!

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.662 line:92%
Yep.

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.497
Just shut up.
[chuckles]

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:14.567
All right, what was
the first tongue twister

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.402 line:92%
you remember hearing?

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.437
Was it "she shells"--
[laughs]

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.573
- Sir, no, sir.
- Was it--was it "she sells"--

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:23.743
Cream cheese is also
only for sales associates.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.611
How come
it's not for me, why?

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:27.246
Because the bagels
are for sales--

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:28.614
- Ron.
- Yes.

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:29.949 line:92%
Time and place, man.

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:30.950
I'm sorry, this guy
just keeps trying

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:31.951 line:92%
to grab a bagel, and--

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.219
Ron, do you want
to come up here

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:34.353 line:92%
and do the presentation?

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:35.421
I'll go back there
and be a jackass?

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.290
You just asked me to make sure
that nobody but--

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.292
"Oh, the sign says--
my name's Ron.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:42.361
I like to drink alcohol
and listen to signs all day."

00:02:42.394 --> 00:02:44.630
He's really relentless
about having a bagel.

00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:46.566
- And I tol--
- Ron, handle your bagels!

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.701 line:92%
I'm trying.

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:50.203 line:92%
Unbelievable, everybody.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.238
All right, I'll just--
I'll start cold.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:53.172 line:92%
Cells make up our bodies,

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:54.774
