00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:59.245
(Ron)
Sir, seriously, stop.

00:02:59.278 --> 00:03:00.446 line:92%
Not even smell?

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:02.248 line:92%
No, no, no!

00:03:02.281 --> 00:03:03.482 line:92%
You can't have any bagels!

00:03:03.515 --> 00:03:04.550 line:92%
