All right, you know what?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.565 line:92%
Just give me a minute.

00:03:19.598 --> 00:03:22.435
I'm gonna try to forget
Ron ruined my day,

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.370
'cause this presentation
is great,

00:03:24.403 --> 00:03:25.771 line:92%
